solve.py / lib.android.puzzle_candidates first (D24, D25: 3/3 modes, <2 s); by hand only if silent: step 5a.\n   Prompt verbs (D24 \"pinned emulator\", D25 \"forge or replay an integrity statement\") have NOT meant live work: the\n   theme is one pure gate fn in the chain. Nothing to forge, replay or emulate unless the dex really calls such APIs.\n   Never chase 127.0.0.1:19090 (device loopback). Never submit a regex-composed ANS- (hex table + dead mixers = decoys).\n1. unzip -l x.apk   -> map the entries:\n   assets/huntress_puzzle.json      v1 codec; data already ANS-? done (D15 native, D19 reflection); new name -> data[:4] vs \"ANS-\"\n                                    data = an entry path (D20 `dynamic`)? open THAT entry, recurse. int list (D5/D17): r[order[i]]=data[i]\n   lib/<abi>/*.so                   strings -a | grep ANS- ; nm -D --defined-only ; no Java_* -> JNI_OnLoad/RegisterNatives\n                                    D16 gate Java_*_native*(int)+*_accepts: objdump -d (bypass len 65536)\n                                    D23 v2 d15 set: Java_*_nativeShare(long) called MID-CHAIN, pure arithmetic: port or unicorn\n   lib/*/libapp.so + libflutter.so  Flutter: strings libapp.so; flutter_assets/kernel_blob.bin (debug = source text)\n   assets/index.android.bundle      RN: head -c8 | xxd; c61fbc03 = Hermes -> hbc-decompiler; else webcrack/js-beautify\n   assemblies/*.dll|*.blob, libmonodroid.so   Xamarin: XALZ = lz4 per-dll; then ilspycmd f.dll\n   libil2cpp.so + global-metadata.dat         Unity IL2CPP: strings global-metadata.dat | grep ANS-\n   assets/www/, cordova.js, capacitor.config  hybrid JS: grep -r in assets/www\n   assets/*.dex|*.jar|*.apk|*.zip|*.bin       dynamic code (D20 plain dex): strings -a first; no dex/PK/ELF magic -> known-\n                                    plaintext unwrap; >1 payload -> host's pinned digest; >1 ANS- -> member the host names\n   libjiagu/libsecexe/libDexHelper.so          packer: payload is the encrypted asset; s