ssLoader), several config splits (`split_config.x86_64`/`arm64_v8a`/`xxhdpi`/`en`) where only the device-\n  matching one counts (oracle = pinned x86_64 emulator), `.so` in a config split, split resources.arsc overrides, split\n  signature/digest binding, AAB/protobuf manifests. Mastery solve 1.13 s for 9 sets (d26): fine, keep per-set cost flat.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nwc -l reference/techniques/mobile-android.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2245,"cache_read_input_tokens":111739,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2245},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b5a4874-41a3-4f1d-b581-92bd56f6f405","uuid":"3d7adad7-9589-4067-acdd-9161060e48e7","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:08:23.420Z","request_id":"req_011CgQuCp6V5xykvV4R3aBP3","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01VhvNCZGr7XbnUZ8ZC1ogMR":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='reference/techniques/mobile-android.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ni=s.index(\"## Pitfalls that cost time\")\ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"## Pitfalls that cost time\n- **Single shape != timed shape** (d23 v1 `xor` vs v2; d26 v1 JSON fragment vs v2 split-bytes read): a solver tested only\n  on the single is silent in TT/Mastery. Treat a schema or container bump as a new construct family.\n- **Generalize cut off / not persisted** (d23, d26): live workers hand-solved; the generalize edit never landed in the\n  solver. Overnight prebuilds close it (d24 went 3/3 on the solver alone) -- the lib path is what carries a day.\n- **Container-only checks** (d26): every member of an `.apks` must be listed; the evidence for the base's chain lives in\n  the feature split. Never read `huntress_feature.*` from the base, neve